# Electron Application

## Overview
The project can be built as an Electron desktop application for:
- macOS
- Windows
- Linux

## Electron Configuration
- Electron-specific code is located in [src-electron/](mdc:src-electron)
- Electron builder configuration is in [quasar.conf.js](mdc:quasar.conf.js) under the `electron` property
- App ID: `com.aloware.talk2`

## Building Electron Apps
- Development: `quasar dev -m electron`
- macOS production: `yarn build-mac` (without notarizing) or `yarn deploy-mac` (with notarizing)
- Windows production: `yarn build-win` (without publishing) or `yarn deploy-win` (with publishing)
- Linux production: `yarn build-linux` (without publishing) or `yarn deploy-linux` (with publishing)

## Notarization
- macOS apps are notarized using [notarize.js](mdc:notarize.js)
- Requires appropriate Apple Developer credentials

## Icons and Resources
- Application icons for different platforms:
  - macOS: `icons/icon.icns`
  - Windows: `icons/icon.ico`
  - Linux: `icons/icon.png`
